# Exclusion-based: the build context is the repository root because the Dockerfile restores
# from several project files, so everything that is not source has to be named here or it
# ships in the context of every image build.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
.git/
.github/
docs/
flyio/
scripts/
tests/
*.md
